Package: polymergenomics
Title: R Client for the Polymer Genomics API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Polymer", "Genomics", email = "dev@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to query the Polymer Genomics REST API,
    returning data as GRanges, GRangesList, and DataFrame objects.
    Supports region queries, gene lookups, probe searches, sequence
    retrieval, and bulk downloads.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
